<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance comparison across Base, SFT, DPO, GRPO, and DeepSeek on four tasks under three evaluation settings: In-Distribution, Out-of-Distribution, and Self-Awareness.</figcaption>
